DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260430
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260501
UID:fo-stock-exp-2026-04-30
DESCRIPTION:NSE MONTHLY STOCK DERIVATIVES EXPIRY\n------------------------
 -----------------\n• Contract Expiry: All Single Stock Futures & Options
  contracts expire today (3:30 PM IST).\n• Physical Delivery: In-the-mone
 y (ITM) long/short stock options result in compulsory physical delivery.\n
 • Margin Escalation: Broker physical delivery margins apply to near-the-
 money and ITM strikes.\n-----------------------------------------\n• Ope
 n in TradingView App (Native):\n  tradingview://chart?symbol=NIFTYFUT\n\n
 • Open in TradingView (Browser):\n  https://in.tradingview.com/chart/?sy
 mbol=NIFTYFUT\n
URL:https://in.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=NIFTYFUT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:NSE Stock F&O Expiry Today: Manage ITM delivery exposure.
TRIGGER:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
